# Color applet: Arizona, then Remove Scheme (Tab: Save Scheme is disabled for an unchanged scheme)
# and Enter (Yes) in the confirmation box: Arizona leaves CONTROL.INI [color schemes] and the combo,
# and the next scheme is selected. Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/color-remove.scn; compare in
# 16 colours (tests/color.sh) and compare OUT/ini/CONTROL.INI with arch311-ref/run-color-remove.
sleep 400
shot shots/01.png
key enter
key down
key tab
key space
sleep 400
shot shots/02.png
key enter
sleep 400
shot shots/03.png
quit
